Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.35,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,This is the Heisei era.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.35,0:00:19.52,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,And this seemingly peaceful \Nresidential neighborhood is called Jouincho. {-cho = ward}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.52,0:00:24.08,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Now then, in this town there was a notorious gang of little brats known far and wide {warugaki gundan = literally "bad brats battalion"}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.49,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,as the Three Great Troublemakers. {itazura daiou sannin aku = literally "kings of mischief, three evils"}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be good and cough it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.49,0:00:30.20,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Though small in stature, they were like peppers — tiny, sharp, and spicy. {Japanese pepper (species of Sichuan pepper, Zanthoxylum piperitum); Japanese prickly ash​}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.20,0:00:34.18,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,People said that whenever trouble broke out in town,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.18,0:00:36.65,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,these three were always somehow involved.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.81,0:00:45.88,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Kanamori Tetsushi was a fifth grader \Nwho ruled the elementary school like a boss.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.23,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,A hothead who never lost\N to anybody in a fight. {gallant; manly; chivalrous}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.66,0:00:54.89,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Niijima Ryoji, nicknamed Ryochin, \Nwas a soft-hearted guy quick to tears,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.89,0:00:57.08,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,but he could run as fast as the wind!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.08,0:00:59.75,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Shiina Yusuke was the brains of the group,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.75,0:01:03.50,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,calm and composed, \Nlike the strategist of their little army.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Manure attack! {/cow dung}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Manure... Fudging cow shit!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.31,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.81,0:01:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Try shaking down \Nelementary school kids again,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and next time you won't get off this easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.90,Narrtop,,0,0,0,,Yo! Japan's number one!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Brats Freak Out over a Ghost!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.93,0:01:37.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now then, on the outskirts of town \Nwere the Twin Ponds, {lit: two ponds, on this pond a ghost appeared - idk why she says "two ponds" if she only talks about one of them next maybe futatsu is actually its name?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.85,0:01:42.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and rumors claimed ghosts appeared there.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.26,0:01:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.76,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means we won the bet, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.22,0:01:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet! Croquettes! {probably the bet was that he buys them lunch?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.18,0:02:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Two for me, two!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I want two too.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.28,0:02:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up! {?? matte? owatte? wakatta?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I thought somebody \Nwas standing behind us just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.65,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that was...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.29,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the ghost from the rumors?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Shiina!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you freaking out?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.77,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.76,0:02:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as ghosts!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.91,0:02:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that all you want, \Nbut they're still scary!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.86,0:02:38.51,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now then, this place was a pharmacy \Ncalled Gokurakudo,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.51,0:02:44.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,though because of its creepy atmosphere, \Npeople called it Jigokudo — "Hell Hall." {gokuraku = heaven; jigoku = hell}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with you all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.33,0:03:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I was in kindergarten, I used to shut my eyes whenever I walked past too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.05,0:03:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jigokudo scared the crap outta me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet Ryochin's still scared of it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.59,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.81,0:03:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetsushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.22,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just hear \Nsomebody whisper in your ear?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.64,0:03:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Skipped school again, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he know that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he can see everything \Nwith that crystal ball of his.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I did?! \NGot a problem with that, Gramps?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.45,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Still as full of hot air as ever, I see. {imperious; proud​}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.70,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in here and have\N some sweet potato candy. {not some standard word but that's what it seems to be; https://www.instacart.com/products/27761582-fujiya-seika-tabekiri-imoame-karaimo-potato-candy-2-82-oz}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.75,0:03:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet potato candy?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, we've got\N this medicine at home too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.32,0:04:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where it came from? \NThis stuff works crazy good on cuts.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we've got this one too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.17,0:04:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is it true there's a ghost at the Twin Ponds?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, cut it out with that story already!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.66,0:04:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that tree \Nin the woods by the pond,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.93,0:04:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the one with the unusually thick \Ngrass around its roots?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that you mention it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.34,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a corpse buried beneath it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A man murdered a woman\N and buried her there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.78,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She died full of regret, \Nso she couldn't pass on and became a ghost.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.77,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell would you \Nknow something like that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.23,0:04:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that woman comes here every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.53,0:04:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Comes here? Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-When?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.24,0:05:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right about this time!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.68,0:05:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't suddenly yell like that! \NYou scared the hell outta me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.39,0:05:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that old geezer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.07,0:05:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think he's messing with us \Njust to scare us, do ya?! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.42,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's investigate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.45,0:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys {\i1}do{\i0} realize \Nwe're digging up a corpse? {implying they brought tools wildly inadequate for the task}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But there wasn't anything better. {?? lit: but there wasn't}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan, where'd you get {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Construction site over at Fourth Block.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really find bones,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,they belong to a murder victim,\N so we'll give 'em to the cops, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.66,0:06:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Might even help catch the killer.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.24,0:06:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! \NGet to it and dig, you bastards! {mimicking the samurai talk when addressing his subordinates}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.02,0:06:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryochin, you're not scared?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.32,0:07:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Ghosts scare me,\N but skeletons don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.23,0:07:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... it sucks thinking somebody got buried all alone out here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.47,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably never even got a funeral.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.50,0:07:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A skeleton!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.27,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.62,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So the old man was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so bored... Wish a fight would break out or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.95,0:08:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Officer Mitamura!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.17,0:08:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, not those brats again...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.70,0:08:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious! {taihen da}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.28,0:08:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What, gonna tell me old man Sakagami's loincloth turned into a youkai again, are ya?! {fundoushi = loincloth; traditional Japanese men's undergarment made from a length of cotton​; ittan-momen = malicious youkai that looks like a piece of cloth - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ittan-momen}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not dumb stuff like that this time!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.20,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a murder case!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A murder case?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.02,0:08:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.46,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out! Human bones!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They were buried under\N a tree by the Twin Ponds.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We found 'em ourselves!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.33,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an idiot for taking you seriously \Neven for a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.70,0:09:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So this is some new kind of prank? \NThis officer here almost fell for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.09,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't a prank! There really is a corpse buried there! These are a woman's bones!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.97,0:09:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, bones, huh? Well, what if I told you \Nthe pet shop on the corner sells piles of 'em?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Pet shop?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.04,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can fool adults\N with dog toys, you're dead wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.20,0:09:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this? \NEven for one of your pranks, this is lousy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the youkai one was more believable. {ittan-momen }
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.45,0:09:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, if you're done here, \Nthen go on home! I'm busy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Super busy!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn geezer...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.39,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast, who're you calling a geezer... {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.28,0:10:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At least check it out, Mittan. {mitamura -> mi-chan -> Mittan}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mittan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Mittan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you brats!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.48,0:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash your brains in and flip 'em inside out \Nso you can never call me Mittan again! {??????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Old geezer!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.25,0:10:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You done screwed us over, \Nyou crusty old bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.17,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What goddamn corpse? \NWhat goddamn ghost?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bones were just dog toys!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.14,0:11:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools are idiots too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.40,0:11:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone murdered a person,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.87,0:11:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,do you really think they'd bury the body \Nshallow enough for kids like you to dig up?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.11,0:11:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you brats \Ncould dig up a corpse.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.51,0:11:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's buried deep, and the cherry tree's roots \Nare tangled all around it too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know all that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.85,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who killed that woman, \Naren't ya, old man?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.92,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying \Nwe can't dig her up, old man?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.80,0:11:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would you do if you did? \NBecome local heroes?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.53,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.85,0:11:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, leader!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.64,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all. \NI wanna get that woman outta the dirt.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she'll never even get a funeral.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Her family's probably worried sick,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.93,0:11:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and maybe the guy who killed her could finally get caught too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.73,0:12:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall give this to you, Tetsushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.93,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully. Right before sunset, \Nstick this talisman onto that tree.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just press it on with your hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.73,0:12:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then point at the talisman with your index and middle fingers
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.90,0:12:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and send your thoughts into it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.59,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Channel your desire \Nto save that woman into it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.26,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, face the talisman and chant this. \NReady? I'm only saying it once.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.81,0:13:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it memorized?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.90,0:13:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan, wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.79,0:13:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet me at the Twin Ponds at four.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.64,0:13:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it, Tecchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.85,0:13:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan's acting weird. \NIt's like he suddenly changed or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.60,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think maybe he's gonna\N drift away from us?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.90,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Ryochin. No matter what happens, \NTecchan's still Tecchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.57,0:14:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is trust him\N and follow his lead.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go buy some croquettes\N from Agetenka. {I can't explain it well, but it sounds like a typical cafe name, though it doesn't seem to be a common noun, so it's weird they've decided to insert such a specific line in here, about two grade school kids going to a specific restaurant for croquettes of all things... ¯\_(ツ)_/¯; HK subs dealt with it brilliantly: "cola cookies for tomorrow"}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.79,0:14:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.60,0:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let that woman go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let her return home.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.86,0:15:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,On abokya beiroshano makabodara mani handoma jinbara harabaritaya un! {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantra_of_Light#Mantra:~:text=On%20abokya%20beiroshan%C5%8D%20makabodara%20mani%20handoma%20jinbara%20harabaritaya%20un}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.45,0:16:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's... power in here.\NBut I don't know yet... what kind of power.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.32,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible power!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.90,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.55,0:16:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.23,0:16:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sweating like crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.20,0:16:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it worked, \Nbut my whole body's tingling. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.96,0:16:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan, Shiina...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.19,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Look.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this for real? {meaning "am I not seeing things?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.59,0:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghosts and spells and all that?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina, go get Mittan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.48,0:17:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Mittan'll actually come?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't trust us, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.40,0:18:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When he sees this, \Neven Mittan'll be blown away. {shocked into believing}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.02,0:18:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.59,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ryochin, wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.09,0:18:33.22,Thought,,0,0,0,,Good... Tecchan's still Tecchan after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.64,0:18:37.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,No matter how much he changes, \Nhe's still Tecchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.14,0:18:44.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And thus, the case was brought to a peaceful conclusion.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.61,0:18:46.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.90,0:18:52.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the normally quiet town of Jouincho was thrown into chaos by the shocking murder case.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.43,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our names never made the papers, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.03,0:18:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Like Tecchan said,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.55,0:19:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,we just told 'em the tree had already fallen over \Nand that's how we found the skeleton. {meaning without involving magic}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.15,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the body out.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.44,0:19:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Want some sweet potato candy?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.94,0:19:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman came last night.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.92,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was finally free, \Nso she was going to see the man.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She went to get revenge.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.62,0:19:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That room over there's\N packed with books, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.74,0:19:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if we come read them sometime?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.97,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Come whenever you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.26,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we're heading to school now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.60,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tecchan, wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.11,0:20:15.91,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now then, what kind of exploits await these Three Great Troublemakers in the future?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Brats Face Off Against Youkai!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It is the Heisei era.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.98,0:20:35.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Kanamori Tetsushi, Niijima Ryoji, \Nand Shiina Yusuke,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.24,0:20:40.05,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the Three Great Troublemakers, \Nattend Jouin Elementary School.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.05,0:20:45.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Behind Jouin Elementary \Nlies the Forbidden Forest. {irazu = without entering - so not exactly "forbidden to enter" but like maybe it's what locals call it to imply that one shouldn't go there, or maybe even the forest's proper name}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.50,0:20:51.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,True to its name, it was a place people \Nwere forbidden to enter, and for good reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.15,0:20:58.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In truth, back in the Heian era,\N this forest once belonged to a powerful clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Not too long ago,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.54,0:21:07.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,people drawn in by its spirits were said\N to become possessed and attack others. {mononoke }
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.98,0:21:10.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A truly terrifying place.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.46,0:21:15.77,Narrator,,0,0,0,,These days, spirits rarely rampage anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.80,0:21:24.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But you'd best discover the rest\N of that story for yourselves. {lit: now then, what follows, look forward to seeing this story}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.56,0:21:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That is simply the flow of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.77,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The flow of time?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.74,0:21:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,People in the old days had to keep \Nall five senses sharp just to survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.62,0:21:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they could sense things \Ninvisible to the eye.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.93,0:21:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And sensing them meant\N opening an entrance.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.17,0:21:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening an entrance?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.34,0:22:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the entrance opens, \Nthings from the other side can come here...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.49,0:22:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and people from this side can go there too.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.84,0:22:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But nowadays, people can survive\N without sharpening their senses.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.36,0:22:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So the entrance has closed.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.67,0:22:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those from the other side\N can rarely cross over anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.68,0:22:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.87,0:22:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.62,0:22:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt all kinds of youkai \Nstill gather in the Forbidden Forest. {irazu no mori}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.17,0:22:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Youkai?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go wandering carelessly\N into that forest.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.98,0:22:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans nowadays don't react\N to spirits as easily anymore, {mononoke}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.66,0:22:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but some creatures attack \Nwhether you notice them or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if one attacks you?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.27,0:22:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All sorts of things.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.99,0:22:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people die. \NSome lose their minds.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.57,0:23:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know... modern humans possess a new kind of opening that didn't exist in the old days.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.07,0:23:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A new one?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.50,0:23:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course you do. It's called...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.96,0:23:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:21.34,0:23:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.38,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Desire, sorrow, jealousy, hatred... \NThe dark side inside human beings. {kage is both "shadow" and "dark side" so I'm not sure what he means}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,People back then had that stuff too.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.73,0:23:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Modern humans let those shadows spread carelessly because the old openings closed.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.76,0:23:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they carry new desires, sorrows, \Nand hatreds that never existed before.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.75,0:23:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And spirits love those shadows. \NThey feed on them.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.79,0:24:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To feed, they cling to humans \Nand make those shadows grow even larger.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.59,0:24:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if your shadow gets eaten?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.09,0:24:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You go insane. Too much hatred \Nand sorrow will drive a person mad.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.56,0:24:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that, some wind up \Nin police custody, some in hospitals...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.61,0:24:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and some end up in the care \Nof Buddhist monks.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.49,0:24:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So all those people got their shadows eaten?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.74,0:24:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.04,0:24:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But some did.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.41,0:24:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,People whose shadows were consumed,\N beyond even a doctor's ability to heal,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:35.76,0:24:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,sink all the way into misery. {lit: that even a doctor can't cure}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:40.05,0:24:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.48,0:24:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're possessed by spirits, \Nhow's a doctor supposed to cure that?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.43,0:24:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Q-Quit laughing, old man! How do we stop our shadows from getting eaten? Tell us already!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.41,0:25:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple, really. Don't hate, don't resent, \Nand don't create an opening for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.68,0:25:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The youkai roaming around here \Ndearly love those weak parts of people.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:12.40,0:25:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you must always \Nlive boldly and fearlessly.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:21.80,0:25:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all? \NThen we're totally fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.30,0:25:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, lend it to me. \NWe're buddies, aren't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.55,0:25:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! \NI haven't finished reading it yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:37.32,0:25:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.29,0:25:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it right back.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.16,0:25:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up already.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.54,0:25:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:44.86,0:25:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see he doesn't want to?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.44,0:25:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.33,0:25:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:52.91,0:25:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.71,0:25:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit acting so damn full of yourself{ all the time}!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.56,0:26:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, knock it off!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.82,0:26:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that, huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:07.05,0:26:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, I'm handing back \Nyour transposition tests from the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.85,0:26:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aida-san. {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.23,0:26:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter that you're strong \Nif you're dumb. {he's flexing his probably better score despite tetsu being stronger in a fight than him}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.20,0:26:20.62,Top,,0,0,0,,Matsumoto-san.{probs?}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.94,0:26:24.48,Top,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.06,0:26:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.20,0:26:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep talking like that, \Nyour shadow's gonna...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.76,0:26:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... well...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.60,0:26:33.38,Top,,0,0,0,,Tachibana-san. {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.20,0:26:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because everyone\N calls you boss all the time,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.33,0:26:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don't go getting cocky, Kanamori.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.33,0:26:37.67,Top,,0,0,0,,And... Nakano-san.{???}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.67,0:26:38.17,Top,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:38.17,0:26:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not acting cocky!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.35,0:26:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.07,0:26:41.32,Top,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:41.32,0:26:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna kiss up to you, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.15,0:26:43.00,Top,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:44.40,0:26:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Always acting so high and mighty...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:44.40,0:26:45.71,Top,,0,0,0,,Machida-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.15,0:26:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.61,0:26:50.19,Top,,0,0,0,,Very well done. Keep that up \Nand you'll end up in a top university. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:47.19,0:26:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then. I won't say another word.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.18,0:26:52.99,Top,,0,0,0,,Next, Tanoda-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.82,0:26:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.36,0:26:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to him right now's pointless.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.30,0:26:57.93,Top,,0,0,0,,Yajima-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.32,0:27:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! {heave-ho}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:08.18,0:27:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Yoshimoto?!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.02,0:27:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.89,0:27:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So then Mittan got all pissed off about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:19.52,0:27:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, getting worked up over little kids...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:24.63,0:27:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.34,0:27:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple "sorry" won't cut it!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:34.93,0:27:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:39.81,0:27:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when'd he become like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.92,0:27:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Too easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.43,0:27:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here ya go!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:14.26,0:28:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:14.89,0:28:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:16.03,0:28:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.28,0:28:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.14,0:28:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto, you bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:30.07,0:28:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand slipped.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.56,0:28:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bullshit me!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.28,0:28:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! {/let it slip}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.24,0:28:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tecchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:40.95,0:28:44.54,Thought,,0,0,0,,Something's weird with him. \NHe's different somehow.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:46.79,0:28:50.15,Thought,,0,0,0,,That's it. He's not scared anymore. {lit: he doesn't run away}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:51.46,0:28:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanamori-kun, are you listening?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:53.82,0:28:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The nosebleed stopped,\N but your lip's split open. 
Dialogue: 10,0:28:57.30,0:28:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna sting for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:59.31,0:29:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Catching a dodgeball with your face... \NYou're as gutsy as ever.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:03.64,0:29:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Being athletic's the only thing \Nyou've got going for you anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:07.80,0:29:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, lady! {neechan}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:10.35,0:29:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:11.81,0:29:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A brat barely ten years old \Nshouldn't be mouthing off like that! {actually "gan wo tareru" is "to glare/stare intensely" but idk}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.15,0:29:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.37,0:29:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my... What's gotten into me? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:21.74,0:29:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fine now, \Nso you can head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:24.18,0:29:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful eating lunch. \NIt's gonna sting!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:29.38,0:29:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.71,0:29:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Yoshimoto \Nhas really crossed the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:34.17,0:29:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryochin, don't mess with Yoshimoto \Nwhen we get back to class.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:38.47,0:29:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?! He obviously did it on purpose!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:41.68,0:29:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. But has Yoshimoto ever \Nactually picked a fight with us before?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:48.41,0:29:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the kind of guy\N with guts like that, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:50.92,0:29:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:53.69,0:29:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stopping by the old man's \Nplace after school today.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.58,0:30:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshimoto's been acting weird lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:05.37,0:30:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always angry, always irritated.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:08.09,0:30:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He kinda scares me...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:22.14,0:30:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a nasty scrape, Tetsushi. {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:26.22,0:30:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme give you some good medicine. \NYusuke, put it on him.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:31.64,0:30:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:37.19,0:30:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man... \NYoshimoto got his shadow eaten, didn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:41.17,0:30:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he might go insane.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:44.32,0:30:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if he did? {get his shadow eaten}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:47.75,0:30:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna help him. \NWhat do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:50.67,0:30:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a screw just naturally \Ncame loose in his head. {literal}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:54.24,0:30:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't necessarily mean\N his shadow was eaten.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:56.80,0:30:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what happened to him!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:58.91,0:31:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,His shadow got eaten.\N We can't just ignore it.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:05.00,0:31:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go confirm it. \NWe'll talk after that.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.85,0:31:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirm it? How do I do that?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:12.90,0:31:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a hand seal, then draw spell characters on both your palms. Like this. {??? idk what touin is but that's what he means; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kuji-in ; also, he means imaginary characters, with his fingers}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:20.18,0:31:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then press together \Nthe thumbs and index fingers
Dialogue: 10,0:31:23.17,0:31:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,of both hands with the spell characters \Nto form a triangle.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:26.64,0:31:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chant the incantation \Nand look through the opening.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:32.96,0:31:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And that'll tell me?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:35.38,0:31:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Spell characters...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:43.04,0:31:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto's walking behind the shrine \Nin the Forbidden Forest right now. Go. {lit: Irazu Shrine - so it is a proper name after all}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:47.96,0:31:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji, Yusuke, you two stay here. \NDo not follow Tetsushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:55.27,0:31:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:56.69,0:31:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoji, it'll be okay. \NYou too, Shiina.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:59.96,0:32:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:00.84,0:32:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.45,0:32:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:06.37,0:32:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. It's Tecchan, after all...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:08.87,0:32:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Garako... {the cat's name, maybe "Galaco" or something}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:36.68,0:32:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Onso hanbadobanba yasowaka! {https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q13270935123 - seems to be another mantra, but even the japanese don't know where it came from or what it means}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:47.76,0:32:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the way I like it... \NHuman hatred feels so good!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:57.79,0:32:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's... a youkai!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:00.17,0:33:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate more... Curse more... \NAh, this feels wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.74,0:33:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are, \Nacting like the boss of Jouin?! {elementary}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:11.99,0:33:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone sucks up to you, \Nand it goes straight to your head!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:33.93,0:33:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:38.07,0:33:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate... Hate more!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:41.68,0:33:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate him, despise him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:47.03,0:33:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.26,0:34:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip, Yoshimoto! \NDon't lose to some monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:14.82,0:34:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:22.58,0:34:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto! Yoshimoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.01,0:34:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.51,0:34:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.29,0:35:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Garako?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:28.40,0:35:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we use the youkai orb?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:33.37,0:35:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The youkai orb?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:37.74,0:35:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:45.54,0:35:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What're we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:47.45,0:35:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Only clueless idiots around me,\N the lot of them... {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.60,0:35:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we gotta ask Tetsushi. \NTetsushi can surely think of something.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:57.28,0:35:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, where's Kanamori today?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:59.58,0:36:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan's absent today.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:02.52,0:36:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:04.38,0:36:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Yoshimoto, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:06.56,0:36:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I figured if it was Kanamori, \Nmaybe he could do something.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:11.86,0:36:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. \NLeave it to Tecchan.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:15.04,0:36:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:17.91,0:36:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill... Kill everyone...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:19.72,0:36:21.16,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:24.87,0:36:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come up to the r-roof for a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.20,0:36:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I kill you?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:34.44,0:36:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tecchan's waiting up there, Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:36.88,0:36:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:39.26,0:36:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:41.20,0:36:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:42.78,0:36:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up on the roof.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:43.81,0:36:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:53.58,0:36:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him... This time for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.32,0:37:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:02.49,0:37:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:14.38,0:37:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.10,0:37:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, overflow with hatred... {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:38.07,0:37:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels wonderful... so wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.84,0:37:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:45.90,0:37:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You should just die!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:49.27,0:37:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Noumaku sanmanda bazaradan... go! {this -ka/-ko at the end is most likely meaningless; https://www.scribd.com/doc/250120703/Noumaku-Sanmanda-Bazaradan-Senda-Makaroshada-Sowataya-Un-Tarata}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:59.93,0:38:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer. \NHang on just a little longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:02.40,0:38:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto, we'll save you now!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:08.16,0:38:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How? How come a brat\N like you has this seal?! {?????? maybe "why would you care about someone like him"}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:17.61,0:38:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You ambushed me?! {???? maybe "cornered" maybe "more of you?!"}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:19.08,0:38:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On girigiri! {probs a part of some mantra too, can't be assed to check}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.63,0:38:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... You dirty scumbag! {??? kitanai yatsu me? implying he does not play fair?}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:34.02,0:38:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pouncing on humans' weaknesses like that! {/take advantage of}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:37.92,0:38:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.38,0:38:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:40.71,0:38:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:03.87,0:39:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it leave?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:04.87,0:39:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it left.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:10.53,0:39:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Tecchan, look...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:11.81,0:39:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the youkai orb?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:13.20,0:39:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Our talismans sealed\N the youkai inside it!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:27.97,0:39:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A pretty impressive seal too.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:35.98,0:39:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You three did well.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:40.86,0:39:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:42.86,0:39:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome! 
Dialogue: 10,0:39:44.49,0:39:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisible powers and all that,\N so freaking cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:47.24,0:39:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm just glad \Nwe managed to save Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.56,0:39:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:51.29,0:39:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:54.15,0:39:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto's a jerk, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:57.56,0:39:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0} a jerk, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:00.17,0:40:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just stand there and watch \Nsomebody rot away right in front of me. {dame ni naru = become useless/hopeless - basically just means he couldn't just watch yoshimoto devolve further into madness}
Dialogue: 10,0:40:03.92,0:40:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he's just a plain old honest-to-goodness mean kid,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:07.85,0:40:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not enough of a scumbag to abandon.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:10.52,0:40:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you understand there are people \Nnot worth saving as well?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:15.85,0:40:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:16.87,0:40:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot save everyone \Nthe way you saved Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:22.15,0:40:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor is there any need to. Understand?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:26.57,0:40:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well. Everything in existence\N is made of two opposing parts.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:32.35,0:40:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Light and shadow. \NYou could call them good and evil.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:36.88,0:40:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither side is inherently good or bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:41.21,0:40:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It is simply a tug-of-war \Nbetween opposing forces.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:47.14,0:40:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, brats, get going already.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:50.91,0:40:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:55.40,0:40:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Garako.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:04.74,0:41:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.45,0:41:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Feeling great today!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:17.00,0:41:23.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,With everyone healthy and getting along again, \Npeace returned once more to Jouin Elementary,
Dialogue: 10,0:41:23.42,0:41:29.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and thus this case too came \Nto a happy and smooth conclusion! {as well as the first story in this episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:41:44.61,0:41:45.84,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary! {the song is "chou kowai" / "super scary"; apparently it was released as a CD along with some other songs I'm guessing from the live-action adaptation of this novel, but I couldn't find any CDs for sale, let alone booklet or lyrics, so translating by ear}
Dialogue: 5,0:41:47.66,0:41:48.97,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:41:54.79,0:41:58.79,Song,,0,0,0,,When a roller coaster \Nis about to fly for the first time
Dialogue: 5,0:41:58.79,0:42:01.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:01.15,0:42:05.37,Song,,0,0,0,,My voice won't even come out \Nfrom how tense I am
Dialogue: 5,0:42:05.37,0:42:07.48,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:07.48,0:42:11.46,Song,,0,0,0,,What if that nice lady\N turns out to be a guy? {nee-chan - maybe actually about someone's actual big sister?}
Dialogue: 5,0:42:11.46,0:42:13.32,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:13.32,0:42:17.95,Song,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna gonna gonna do then? \NI'm scared stiff {???????}
Dialogue: 5,0:42:17.95,0:42:23.24,Song,,0,0,0,,I then slam slam slam it, \Nright into the sky! {?????}
Dialogue: 5,0:42:23.24,0:42:26.24,Song,,0,0,0,,Just calm your heart and laugh it off {???????}
Dialogue: 5,0:42:26.24,0:42:27.80,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:42:27.80,0:42:29.44,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:29.44,0:42:30.94,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:42:30.94,0:42:32.58,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone
Dialogue: 5,0:42:32.58,0:42:34.22,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:42:34.22,0:42:35.78,Song,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 5,0:42:35.78,0:42:37.34,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:42:37.34,0:42:39.14,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll never lose!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:39.14,0:42:44.84,Song,,0,0,0,,We're the gutsiest guys in the world! {lit: #1 in the world strong guts}
Dialogue: 5,0:42:47.01,0:42:50.94,Song,,0,0,0,,The smell from the nurse's office \Nfeels like it's gonna kill me
Dialogue: 5,0:42:50.94,0:42:53.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:53.33,0:42:57.43,Song,,0,0,0,,Feels like the bullies\N are gonna stuff me in a box
Dialogue: 5,0:42:57.43,0:42:59.69,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:42:59.69,0:43:03.51,Song,,0,0,0,,I messed with my brother's computer and broke it
Dialogue: 5,0:43:03.51,0:43:05.48,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:05.48,0:43:10.21,Song,,0,0,0,,So what am I gonna gonna gonna do now?\N Puff out my chest
Dialogue: 5,0:43:10.21,0:43:15.38,Song,,0,0,0,,And then thud thud thud,\N charge ahead full force!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:15.38,0:43:18.28,Song,,0,0,0,,Just stay positive and laugh it off
Dialogue: 5,0:43:18.28,0:43:20.10,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:43:20.10,0:43:21.58,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared
Dialogue: 5,0:43:21.58,0:43:23.30,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:43:23.30,0:43:24.76,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a future ahead!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:24.76,0:43:26.43,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:43:26.43,0:43:28.01,Song,,0,0,0,,If you get serious
Dialogue: 5,0:43:28.01,0:43:29.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Rattle rattle rattle
Dialogue: 5,0:43:29.58,0:43:31.28,Song,,0,0,0,,Your dreams will come true
Dialogue: 5,0:43:31.28,0:43:37.26,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's become the toughest guys in the world! {??????? pink?}
Dialogue: 5,0:43:44.04,0:43:46.82,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:49.50,0:43:50.84,Song,,0,0,0,,Super scary!
Dialogue: 5,0:43:51.40,0:43:56.07,Song,,0,0,0,,So what am I gonna gonna gonna do now? \NJust enter the fray
Dialogue: 5,0:43:56.07,0:44:01.18,Song,,0,0,0,,And then you thud thud thud, \Nthrow yourself into overdrive
Dialogue: 5,0:44:01.18,0:44:04.12,Song,,0,0,0,,You man up and laugh it off
